	'............'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_046c7:
	ZH 1:
	'Redeye was in a good mood.'
	R
	'Rona was sitting next to it,'
	R
	'thinking hard.'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_0468f:
	ZH 1:
	'Today ME’ll KILL YOU some more'
	R
	'detestable humans.'
	R
	'KILL YOU to pieces!'
	\L_047b4:
	ZH 1:
	'Like that Freak OLD MAN, smash.'
	R
	'That was DANGEROUS danger, but'
	R
	'somehow ME SAFE. LUCKY.'
	\L_047b4:
	ZH 1:
	'With him dead, nothing is'
	R
	'DANGEROUS to ME.'
	\L_047b4:
	ZH 1:
	'I feel great. HEART is cheerful.'
	R
	'ME would always be HAPPY like'
	R
	'this. Huh, Rona?'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_046ff:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_0468f:
	ZH 1:
	'Rona, YOU answer.'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_046ff:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_0468f:
	ZH 1:
	'Rona!!'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_046ff:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_04737:
	ZH 1:
	'Rona was gripping a dagger in'
	R
	'her small hands.'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_0468f:
	ZH 1:
	'Rona, what’s that SWORD...?'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_046ff:
	ZH 1:
	'A lot of people will die as'
	R
	'long as I’m alive...'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_04737:
	ZH 1:
	'Rona slowly brought the dagger'
	R
	'closer to herself.'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_0468f:
	ZH 1:
	'NOOOOOOOO!'
	R
	'What are YOU doing, Rona?!'
	R
	'YOU insane!'
	\L_047b4:
	ZH 1:
	'If YOU die, your CHILD will'
	R
	'DIIIIE too. YOU have MOTHER'
