	'I’m sorry... Everyone...'
	\L_047b4:
	ZH 1:
	'Freak...'
	\L_047b4:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m sorry...!!'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_0468f:
	ZH 1:
	'NOOOOOOOOO!!'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_046ff:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu...!!'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_046c7:
	ZH 1:
	'Rona stabbed the dagger into'
	R
	'her throat before Redeye could'
	R
	'stop her.'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
	\L_04761:
	\L_04737:
	ZH 1:
	'Her body fell over while still'
	R
	'grasping the dagger.'
	\L_047b4:
	\L_047a7:
